    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22507" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inconnīvus</span></b>  (better <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">incōnīvus</span></b> ), a,
		um, adj.
		2. in-coniveo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that does not close the eyes</i>, <i>sleepless</i> (Appuleian; cf. 
